---
description: Backend NestJS platform rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Use NestJS, Fastify, Drizzle, node-postgres, Zod DTOs, and Swagger.

Derive tenant, actor, roles, and permissions from the verified session. Never trust browser-supplied tenantId, employeeId authority, or roles.

Set transaction-local PostgreSQL tenant context before tenant-owned queries.

Activation, task generation, assignments, and billing inserts for one onboarding request must commit or roll back together.

Require idempotency for service activation. Duplicate requests must not create duplicate engagements or tasks.
